comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T23:07:57.955Z","harness:codex","Scope disposition 2026-08-01: this tranche is implementing the upstream budget reachability, cursor-chain amortization, and egress receipt semantics first. The usage-ledger correction requires the SDK-owned context/next extraction still open on pm-z5pmf8 so it can consume the exact post-egress delivered rows without adding a second projection pass inside CLI commands. Leaving this distinct data-quality item open and unclaimed; no source edit is being made for it in this PR."
  "2026-09-01T15:48:15.172Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-09-01: context and next now attach an internal serving receipt, defer ledger finalization until the actual CLI/SDK/MCP projection is known, and write schema-v2 serve plus delivery records correlated by serve_id. Included rows are the exact IDs emitted after final egress; suppressed payloads record omitted=true and an empty delivered_item_ids set. Affinity consumes only correlated delivered IDs and excludes legacy/pre-delivery phantom inclusions. The final-output boundary is set before hooks and telemetry, and feedback persistence degrades to explicit warnings without replacing a successful read. Temporary-project acceptance produced 22 ledger events including 8 delivery records, all correlated, with a deliberately one-token omitted next response recording no delivered IDs. Exact coverage passed 596 files / 8260 tests at 100/100/100/100; strict static, SDK surface, package, npx/bunx, and installed npm/Bun acceptance all passed."
  "2026-09-01T17:16:29.412Z","harness:codex","Review round evidence: affinity now requires a correlated v2 delivery and never trusts pre-egress delivered_item_ids; serving IDs normalize once; serve rows retain packed_item_ids only; quiet, host-suppressed, service-rendered, and custom-rendered output produce explicit zero-delivery omission receipts; object service projections retain the symbol receipt; delivery-write failure no longer prevents authoritative touches; evaluation fixtures now model serve-delivery-touch. Linked focused suite passed 72/72 and exact repo coverage passed 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-09-01T18:28:29.996Z","harness:codex","Late-review hardening evidence: handled output_format services that return primitives or arrays now preserve the serving receipt on an explicit result_omitted carrier. Object service results retain their structured receipt path; strings, quiet mode, and custom renderers remain explicit omissions. Focused output suite passed 39/39."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T15:48:17.781Z","harness:codex","Usage feedback is valid only at final egress: preserve the pre-egress serve for correlation, but train affinity exclusively from the post-projection delivered ID set and represent omission explicitly."
